### Editar un cliente
PUT http://localhost:8002/api/clientes/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
  "nombre_completo": "Juan Pérez Actualizado",
  "tipo_documento": "CC",
  "num_documento": "1122334455",
